{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addGeoJSONSourceFeatures","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"forSourceId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sourceId","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"features"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10MapboxMaps7Featurea","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/Feature","text":"Feature"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"text":"dataId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"text":"? = nil)","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"sourceId","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The identifier of the style source.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An array of GeoJSON features to be added to the source."}]}],"name":"features"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An arbitrary string used to track the given GeoJSON data."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"dataId"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The add operation will be scheduled and applied on a GeoJSON serialization queue."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to capture events when actual data is drawn on the map please refer to Events API","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and listen to "},{"code":"onSourceDataLoaded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (optionally pass the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dataId"},{"text":" parameter to filter the events)","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"code":"onMapLoadingError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"type = metadata","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if data parsing error has occurred."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Partially updating a GeoJSON source is not compatible with using shared cache and generated IDs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It is important to ensure that every feature in the GeoJSON style source, as well as the newly added","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature, has a unique ID (or a unique promote ID if in use). Failure to provide unique IDs will result"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"map-loading-error"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method allows the user to provide a data ID, which will be returned as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dataId"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source-data-loaded"},{"text":" event. However, it’s important to note that multiple partial updates can be queued","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the same GeoJSON source when ongoing source parsing is taking place. In these cases, the partial","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"updates will be applied to the source in batches. Only the data ID provided in the most recent call within","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each batch will be included in the "},{"code":"source-data-loaded","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" event. If no data ID is provided in the most recent"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"call, the data ID in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","